### 五、加密与安全扩展用法

#### 1. OpenSSL 扩展

SSL/TLS 安全通信。

```php
<?php
// 加密/解密
$data = "敏感数据";
$key = openssl_random_pseudo_bytes(32);
$iv = openssl_random_pseudo_bytes(16);

$encrypted = openssl_encrypt($data, 'aes-256-cbc', $key, 0, $iv);
$decrypted = openssl_decrypt($encrypted, 'aes-256-cbc', $key, 0, $iv);

echo $decrypted . "\n";

// 签名/验证
$privateKey = openssl_pkey_get_private('file://private.pem');
openssl_sign($data, $signature, $privateKey, OPENSSL_ALGO_SHA256);

$publicKey = openssl_pkey_get_public('file://public.pem');
$valid = openssl_verify($data, $signature, $publicKey, OPENSSL_ALGO_SHA256);
echo $valid ? '签名有效' : '签名无效';
?>
```

#### 2. Sodium 扩展

现代密码学。

```php
<?php
// 密码哈希
$password = 'user_password';
$hash = sodium_crypto_pwhash_str(
    $password,
    SODIUM_CRYPTO_PWHASH_OPSLIMIT_INTERACTIVE,
    SODIUM_CRYPTO_PWHASH_MEMLIMIT_INTERACTIVE
);

if (sodium_crypto_pwhash_str_verify($hash, $password)) {
    echo "密码验证成功\n";
}

// 对称加密
$key = sodium_crypto_secretbox_keygen();
$nonce = random_bytes(SODIUM_CRYPTO_SECRETBOX_NONCEBYTES);
$message = '机密消息';
$ciphertext = sodium_crypto_secretbox($message, $nonce, $key);
$plaintext = sodium_crypto_secretbox_open($ciphertext, $nonce, $key);
echo $plaintext . "\n";
?>
